### Dashboard API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Get Dashboard Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Get Dashboard Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get Dashboard Analytics with Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/analytics?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get Recent Activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get Recent Activities with Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/activities?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Get Platform Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/stats/platforms
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Get Automation Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/stats/automations
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Get Message Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/stats/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Get Performance Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Get User Growth Data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/growth
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}